-- title:
--   Explicit derivative unit certificate for a monic polynomial in time
-- statement:
--   Let A be a commutative complex algebra, D a complex-linear derivation of A,
--   and t an element of A such that D(t)=1. Let g be a monic complex polynomial
--   of degree d, and put p=g(t). Then:
--
--   1. For every natural number k, D^k(p)=g^(k)(t).
--   2. D^d(p) is the image of d! in A.
--   3. (d!)^(-1) D^d(p)=1, where multiplication by the complex scalar is the
--      scalar action of the algebra.
--   4. D^k(p)=0 whenever d<k.
--   5. For every k with d≤k, the ideal generated by p,Dp,...,D^k(p) is the unit ideal.
--
--   The statement includes degree zero and does not require A to be nontrivial.
-- source:
--   Derived polynomial-ring calculation associated with the differential method discussed in Senthil Kumar K (2026), Appendix A, https://doi.org/10.1017/S001309152610145X. This certificate is derived here and is not a quoted theorem of that article. For a complex-algebra derivation D and t with D(t)=1, a monic polynomial g of degree d satisfies D^k(g(t))=(g^(k))(t), D^d(g(t))=d!, and (d!)^(-1) D^d(g(t))=1. Higher derivatives vanish, and derivatives through every k at least d generate the unit ideal. The proof uses only Mathlib.

import Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic
import Mathlib.RingTheory.Derivation.Basic
import Mathlib.RingTheory.Ideal.Span

theorem WeierstrassEllipticZeta.monic_time_polynomial_derivative_certificate
    (A : Type*) [CommRing A] [Algebra ℂ A]
    (D : Derivation ℂ A A) (t : A) (ht : D t = 1)
    (g : Polynomial ℂ) (hg : g.Monic) :
    (∀ k : ℕ, D^[k] (Polynomial.aeval t g) =
      Polynomial.aeval t (Polynomial.derivative^[k] g)) ∧
    D^[g.natDegree] (Polynomial.aeval t g) =
      algebraMap ℂ A (g.natDegree.factorial : ℂ) ∧
    (g.natDegree.factorial : ℂ)⁻¹ • D^[g.natDegree] (Polynomial.aeval t g) = 1 ∧
    (∀ k : ℕ, g.natDegree < k → D^[k] (Polynomial.aeval t g) = 0) ∧
    (∀ k : ℕ, g.natDegree ≤ k →
      Ideal.span (Set.range (fun i : Fin (k + 1) =>
        D^[i.val] (Polynomial.aeval t g))) = ⊤) := by sorry
